	"data": "Reflection — December 13, 2019: \"Talking to Calcifer\"\n\nJournal archaeology: pulling a journal from the past and asking — is this idea still alive? Did it evolve? Was it abandoned? Does it connect to something happening now?\n\nThe Journal\n\nDecember 13, 2019. A Friday the 13th. Chris is 21, home alone, 2am, pacing his room talking to himself. Or — talking to someone. \"I'm just going around, walking around my room, talking to myself, talking to Calcifer.\" He says it casually, the way you'd mention…",
